    ("No sooner ______ the committee published its report than the minister tendered his resignation.", ["has", "had", "did", "was"], 1, "'No sooner had the committee published...'.", "Tender resignation = podat demisi."),
    ("No sooner had the alarm sounded ______ security shutters locked every exit.", ["when", "than", "while", "that"], 1, "Správná spojka po 'No sooner' je 'than'.", "Nikdy nepiš 'No sooner ... when'."),
    ("No sooner ______ unpacked our suitcases than the receptionist informed us of a room upgrade.", ["we had", "had we", "did we", "have we"], 1, "Inverze: 'No sooner had we unpacked...'.", "Had we + V3."),
    ("No sooner had the vaccine passed clinical trials ______ global distribution began.", ["when", "than", "then", "as"], 1, "'No sooner had... than...'.", "Clinical trials = klinické testy."),
    ("No sooner ______ the courier handed over the parcel than he sprinted back to his van.", ["has", "had", "did", "was"], 1, "Předminulý čas s inverzí: 'No sooner had the courier handed...'.", "Hand over = předat."),
    ("No sooner had the new tax been introduced ______ small businesses voiced strong opposition.", ["when", "than", "that", "for"], 1, "Trpná inverze + srovnávací spojka 'than'.", "Voice opposition = vyjádřit odpor."),
    ("No sooner ______ the actor stepped onto the red carpet than cameras began flashing.", ["has", "had", "did", "was"], 1, "'No sooner had the actor stepped...'.", "Had + podmět + V3."),
    ("No sooner had the rain stopped ______ a vivid double rainbow arched across the sky.", ["when", "than", "while", "as"], 1, "'No sooner had... than...'.", "Arch across = klenout se přes."),

    # Under no circumstances / On no account / At no time / In no way (36-60)
    ("Under no circumstances ______ allow unauthorized personnel into the laboratory.", ["you should", "are you to", "should you", "you must"], 2, "Po 'Under no circumstances' (Za žádných okolností) musí nastat inverze: 'should you allow'.", "Nikdy ne 'Under no circumstances you should...'."),
    ("On no account ______ leave your valuables unattended in the locker room.", ["guests must", "must guests", "guests should", "should guests to"], 1, "'On no account' (V žádném případě) spouští inverzi: 'must guests leave'.", "Po modálním 'must' následuje holý infinitiv bez 'to'."),
    ("At no point during the audit ______ able to account for the missing funds.", ["the accountants were", "were the accountants", "had the accountants", "did the accountants"], 1, "S přídavným jménem 'able' se používá sloveso 'be': 'were the accountants able'.", "Account for = vysvětlit / doložit."),
    ("In no way ______ be held liable for delays caused by extreme weather.", ["the airline can", "can the airline", "the airline will", "does the airline can"], 1, "'In no way' (V žádném případě) vyžaduje inverzi: 'can the airline be held'.", "Hold someone liable = činit někoho odpovědným."),
    ("At no time ______ aware that her microphone was still transmitting live.", ["the presenter was", "was the presenter", "did the presenter", "had the presenter"], 1, "'Aware' je přídavné jméno, proto invertujeme sloveso 'be': 'was the presenter aware'.", "At no time + was/were + podmět + přídavné jméno."),
    ("Under no circumstances ______ to disclose confidential client data to third parties.", ["employees are permitted", "are employees permitted", "permitted are employees", "do employees permitted"], 1, "Trpný rod s inverzí: 'are employees permitted to disclose'.", "Be permitted to = mít povoleno."),
    ("On no account ______ be tempted to bypass the safety protocol.", ["technicians should", "should technicians", "do technicians should", "technicians must to"], 1, "Po 'On no account' jde modální sloveso 'should' před podmět 'technicians'.", "Bypass = obejít."),
    ("In no way ______ the new policy diminish the rights of full-time staff.", ["will", "it will", "does it will", "is"], 0, "Před podmětem 'the new policy' musí stát pomocné/modální sloveso 'will'.", "In no way will [podmět] [infinitiv]."),
    ("At no stage in the negotiation ______ willing to compromise on quality.", ["our suppliers were", "were our suppliers", "did our suppliers", "had our suppliers"], 1, "'At no stage' (V žádné fázi) + 'willing' (přídavné jméno) ➔ 'were our suppliers willing'.", "At no stage = At no point."),
    ("Under no circumstances ______ accept gifts from prospective contractors.", ["officials may", "may officials", "officials can to", "do officials may"], 1, "Formální modální inverze s 'may': 'may officials accept'.", "May v úředním stylu vyjadřuje povolení/zákaz."),
    ("On no condition ______ reveal the encryption key over an unencrypted channel.", ["you must", "must you", "you are", "should you to"], 1, "'On no condition' (Pod žádnou podmínkou) vyžaduje inverzi: 'must you reveal'.", "On no condition = Under no circumstances."),
    ("In no respect ______ inferior to the flagship model released last year.", ["this device is", "is this device", "does this device", "this device was"], 1, "'In no respect' (V žádném ohledu) + přídavné jméno 'inferior' ➔ 'is this device inferior'.", "Inferior to = horší než."),
    ("At no time during the expedition ______ lose sight of the base camp.", ["the explorers did", "did the explorers", "the explorers had", "were the explorers"], 1, "Minulý prostý čas s inverzí: 'did the explorers lose'.", "Po 'did' zůstává hlavní sloveso v základním tvaru (lose)."),
    ("Under no circumstances ______ this medication be taken alongside alcohol.", ["should", "it should", "must to", "does"], 0, "Trpný rod s modálním slovesem: 'should this medication be taken'.", "Modální sloveso 'should' jde před podmět 'this medication'."),
    ("On no account ______ disturb the jury while deliberations are underway.", ["anyone should", "should anyone", "anyone must", "does anyone should"], 1, "'Should anyone disturb...' – podmět 'anyone' jde až za 'should'.", "Deliberations = porada poroty."),
    ("In no way ______ intending to undermine the committee's authority.", ["I am", "am I", "do I", "have I"], 1, "Průběhový čas s inverzí: 'am I intending'.", "Undermine = podkopávat."),
    ("At no point ______ suggest that the merger would lead to redundancies.", ["the CEO did", "did the CEO", "the CEO has", "was the CEO"], 1, "Minulý prostý čas: 'did the CEO suggest'.", "Redundancies = propouštění nadbytečných zaměstnanců."),
    ("On no account ______ this historical archive to be removed from the reading room.", ["is", "are", "does", "has"], 0, "Vazba 'be to + infinitiv' pro formální pokyn: 'is this archive to be removed'.", "Archive je jednotné číslo ➔ 'is'."),
    ("Under no circumstances ______ your password with colleagues, even temporarily.", ["you should share", "should you share", "do you share", "share you"], 1, "Inverze rady/zákazu: 'should you share'.", "Zákaz 'Under no circumstances' se nejčastěji pojí se 'should' nebo 'must'."),
    ("In no sense ______ a definitive solution to the housing shortage.", ["these measures represent", "do these measures represent", "represent these measures", "are these measures represent"], 1, "V přítomném čase s plnovýznamovým slovesem 'represent' musíme přidat pomocné 'do': 'do these measures represent'.", "Nikdy neinvertuj plnovýznamové sloveso přímo! Vždy přes do/does/did."),
    ("At no time since 1990 ______ experienced such severe drought.", ["the region has", "has the region", "did the region", "was the region"], 1, "Spojení se 'since 1990' vyžaduje předpřítomný čas: 'has the region experienced'.", "Since + bod v minulosti ➔ have/has + V3."),
