    # Seldom / Rarely / Never / Little / Nowhere (61-85)
    ("Seldom ______ witnessed such an extraordinary display of athletic endurance.", ["we have", "have we", "did we", "we did"], 1, "'Seldom' na začátku věty vyžaduje inverzi: 'have we witnessed'.", "Seldom / Rarely + have + podmět + V3."),
