    ("Little ______ know that the train we had just missed was delayed indefinitely.", ["we did", "did we", "had we", "were we"], 1, "Minulý prostý čas s 'Little': 'did we know'.", "Indefinitely = na neurčito."),
    ("Rarely ______ seen an audience remain completely silent for three full hours.", ["I have", "have I", "did I", "am I"], 1, "'Rarely have I seen...'.", "Zážitek do přítomnosti ➔ have I seen."),
