    ("Never again ______ trust an unverified source without checking the original data.", ["I will", "will I", "do I", "shall I to"], 1, "Budoucí slib/rozhodnutí: 'Never again will I trust...'.", "Never again will/shall + podmět."),
    ("Seldom ______ a single photograph captured the spirit of an entire generation so well.", ["has", "have", "is", "was"], 0, "'A single photograph' (j. č.) + 'captured' ➔ 'has a single photograph captured'.", "Capture the spirit = zachytit ducha."),
    ("Little ______ imagine how radically remote work would reshape urban centres.", ["people did", "did people", "had people", "were people"], 1, "'Little did people imagine...'.", "Reshape = přetvořit."),
