    ("Not only ______ fluent in Mandarin, but he also reads classical Japanese.", ["he is", "is he", "does he", "has he"], 1, "S přídavným jménem 'fluent' invertujeme sloveso 'be': 'Not only is he fluent...'.", "Fluent in = plynulý v."),
