    ("Not until the storm subsided ______ able to assess the structural damage.", ["engineers were", "were engineers", "did engineers", "had engineers"], 1, "'Not until [vedlejší věta]' ➔ inverze v hlavní větě se slovesem 'be': 'were engineers able'.", "Subside = utichnout / opadnout."),
    ("Only by investing heavily in R&D ______ hope to stay ahead of rivals.", ["the company can", "can the company", "does the company can", "the company may"], 1, "'Only by + -ing' ➔ 'can the company hope'.", "R&D = Research and Development."),
