    ("Not until I visited Kyoto ______ understand the subtleties of Japanese garden design.", ["I did", "did I", "had I", "was I"], 1, "'Not until I visited... did I understand...'.", "Subtleties = jemné nuance."),
    ("Only in recent decades ______ begun to grasp the complexity of deep-sea ecosystems.", ["marine biologists have", "have marine biologists", "did marine biologists", "were marine biologists"], 1, "'Only in recent decades' (Teprve v posledních desetiletích) ➔ předpřítomný čas s inverzí: 'have marine biologists begun'.", "Have + podmět + V3 (begun)."),
    ("Not only ______ affordable, it is also remarkably durable.", ["this material is", "is this material", "does this material", "has this material"], 1, "Přídavné jméno 'affordable' vyžaduje invertované 'be': 'Not only is this material affordable...'.", "Durable = odolný / trvanlivý."),
    ("Only by reading extensively ______ develop an intuitive feel for formal register.", ["students can", "can students", "do students can", "will students to"], 1, "'Only by + -ing' ➔ 'can students develop'.", "Extensively = rozsáhle / hodně."),
    ("Not until the whistle blew ______ realize how exhausted he actually was.", ["the runner did", "did the runner", "had the runner", "was the runner"], 1, "Minulý prostý čas: 'did the runner realize'.", "Inverze je vždy v hlavní větě."),
    ("Only after three failed attempts ______ locate the fault in the circuit board.", ["the technician did", "did the technician", "was the technician", "the technician could"], 1, "'Only after + předmět' ➔ 'did the technician locate'.", "Locate = najít / lokalizovat."),
    ("Not only ______ the historic theatre renovated, but its acoustics were also modernized.", ["was", "did", "has", "were"], 0, "Trpný rod v minulém čase: 'Not only was the historic theatre renovated...'.", "Renovated je příčestí trpné ➔ potřebuje 'was'."),
    ("Only when all signatories concur ______ be amended.", ["the charter can", "can the charter", "does the charter", "will the charter to"], 1, "Trpný modální tvar s inverzí: 'can the charter be amended'.", "Amend = pozměnit (zákon, smlouvu)."),
    ("Not until the vaccine became widely available ______ return to normal.", ["did daily life", "daily life did", "was daily life", "had daily life"], 0, "Sloveso 'return' v hlavní větě vyžaduje 'did': 'did daily life return'.", "Return to normal = vrátit se k normálu."),
    ("Only by enforcing stricter regulations ______ curb illegal logging.", ["authorities can", "can authorities", "do authorities can", "authorities will"], 1, "'Only by + -ing' ➔ 'can authorities curb'.", "Curb = omezit / zkrotit."),
    ("Not only ______ donate generously to the charity, she also volunteered every weekend.", ["she did", "did she", "was she", "had she"], 1, "Minulý čas s 'Not only': 'Not only did she donate...'.", "Donate generously = štědře přispět."),
    ("Only after the dust settled ______ the true extent of the landslide become apparent.", ["did", "was", "had", "does"], 0, "Hlavní věta má sloveso 'become' v základním tvaru, proto potřebuje 'did': 'did the true extent... become apparent'.", "Extent = rozsah."),

    # Inverted Conditionals & So/Such Inversions (111-130)
    ("Had I known about the traffic disruption, I ______ an earlier train.", ["would catch", "would have caught", "will catch", "had caught"], 1, "Invertovaný 3. kondicionál: 'Had I known' (= If I had known) ➔ 'would have caught'.", "Had + podmět + V3 = If + podmět + had + V3."),
    ("Were you to reconsider your resignation, the board ______ delighted to retain you.", ["will be", "would be", "is", "had been"], 1, "Invertovaný 2. kondicionál: 'Were you to reconsider' (= If you reconsidered) ➔ 'would be'.", "Were + podmět + to + infinitiv = hypotetický 2. kondicionál."),
    ("Should you require any further clarification, please ______ our legal department.", ["contact", "to contact", "contacting", "will contact"], 0, "Invertovaný 1. kondicionál: 'Should you require' (= If you should require). V rozkazu následuje infinitiv 'contact'.", "Should you need... = velmi formální 'Pokud byste potřeboval...'."),
    ("Had it not been for the pilot's swift reaction, disaster ______ inevitable.", ["would be", "would have been", "had been", "will be"], 1, "Invertovaná vazba 3. kondicionálu: 'Had it not been for...' (= Kdyby nebylo...) ➔ 'would have been'.", "Vazba na zapamatování: Had it not been for + noun."),
    ("Were the government to abolish tuition fees, university enrolment ______ dramatically.", ["will rise", "would rise", "rises", "had risen"], 1, "Hypotetická budoucnost (2. kondicionál): 'Were X to abolish... would rise'.", "Enrolment = zápis ke studiu."),
    ("Should the package arrive damaged, ______ it immediately and photograph the label.", ["reject", "to reject", "rejected", "will reject"], 0, "Formální instrukce (1. kondicionál): 'Should the package arrive..., reject it'.", "V rozkazovací větě je sloveso v základním tvaru."),
    ("So intense ______ that firefighters could not approach within fifty metres of the warehouse.", ["the heat was", "was the heat", "did the heat", "the heat had"], 1, "Vazba 'So + přídavné jméno + SLOVESO + PODMĚT that...': 'So intense was the heat that...'.", "U 'So + adj' se sloveso 'be' staví před podmět."),
    ("Such ______ of the symphony that the audience gave a ten-minute standing ovation.", ["the brilliance was", "was the brilliance", "did the brilliance", "brilliant was"], 1, "Vazba 'Such + SLOVESO + PODMĚT that...': 'Such was the brilliance...'.", "So + adj, ale Such + noun!"),
    ("Had she double-checked the coordinates, the probe ______ off course.", ["would not drift", "would not have drifted", "will not drift", "had not drifted"], 1, "3. kondicionál (minulost): 'Had she double-checked..., the probe would not have drifted'.", "Drift off course = odchýlit se z kurzu."),
    ("Were it not for the strict confidentiality clause, I ______ the entire story.", ["will tell", "would tell", "told", "would have told"], 1, "Invertovaný 2. kondicionál (přítomnost): 'Were it not for...' (= Nebýt toho teď) ➔ 'would tell'.", "Were it not for = přítomnost; Had it not been for = minulost."),
    ("So rapidly ______ that even seasoned analysts struggled to update their forecasts.", ["the market shifted", "did the market shift", "was the market shift", "shifted the market"], 1, "'So + příslovce' na začátku věty spouští inverzi: 'So rapidly did the market shift that...'.", "Seasoned analysts = ostřílení analytici."),
    ("Such ______ the public outcry that the proposed congestion charge was scrapped overnight.", ["was", "were", "did", "had"], 0, "Jednotné číslo 'the public outcry' ➔ 'Such was the public outcry that...'.", "Outcry = vlna nevole / protestů."),
    ("Should you encounter any technical glitches, do not hesitate ______ support.", ["contacting", "to contact", "contact", "to contacting"], 1, "Po 'hesitate' následuje vždy infinitiv s 'to': 'do not hesitate to contact'.", "Should you encounter = Pokud byste narazil na."),
    ("Had they secured funding earlier, the clinic ______ operational right now.", ["would have been", "would be", "will be", "is"], 1, "Smíšený invertovaný kondicionál: Minulá podmínka ('Had they secured') + přítomný následek ('right now' ➔ 'would be').", "Sleduj časový ukazatel 'right now'!"),
    ("So convincing ______ that even the sceptics nodded in agreement.", ["her presentation was", "was her presentation", "did her presentation", "her presentation"], 1, "Inverze se 'So + přídavné jméno': 'So convincing was her presentation that...'.", "Sceptics = skeptici."),
    ("Were you to ask me for an honest assessment, I ______ recommend postponing the launch.", ["will", "would", "did", "can"], 1, "Zdvořilý 2. kondicionál: 'Were you to ask me..., I would recommend...'.", "Skvělá fráze do formálního Speakingu i Writingu!"),
    ("Had the warning signs not been ignored, the bridge collapse ______ prevented.", ["could be", "could have been", "will be", "was"], 1, "Trpný 3. kondicionál s modálním slovesem: 'could have been prevented'.", "Could have been + V3 = mohlo být zabráněno."),
    ("So persuasive ______ that the jury reached a unanimous verdict within an hour.", ["the prosecutor's closing statement was", "was the prosecutor's closing statement", "did the prosecutor's closing statement", "is the prosecutor's closing statement"], 1, "I dlouhý podmět jde celý až za sloveso 'was': 'So persuasive was [dlouhý podmět]...'.", "Unanimous verdict = jednomyslný verdikt."),
    ("Such ______ of the storm that coastal roads remained impassable for days.", ["the ferocity was", "was the ferocity", "were the ferocity", "did the ferocity"], 1, "'Such was the ferocity of the storm that...'.", "Ferocity = zuřivost / prudkost."),
    ("Should any dispute arise regarding this contract, it ______ resolved through arbitration.", ["shall be", "would have been", "was", "had been"], 0, "Formální smluvní 1. kondicionál s 'shall': 'Should any dispute arise..., it shall be resolved...'.", "Shall se v právnickém C1 textu používá pro závazná pravidla.")
